        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be a cat. Climb everything. Breathe.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MeCatVR</strong> is a cozy VR adventure with light parkour. You wander a witch’s warm home and a moonlit courtyard, bat things off shelves, open drawers, and scale a giant tree into the clouds. There’s no text, no HUD, no pop-ups, just natural, hand-driven interactions that keep everything intuitive and language-free. No danger, no rush, just a space to play, explore and feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553930/extras/b7a7a4166572f9742e3f47ff9b660090.avif?t=1768389271\" width=1560 height=678 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you’ll do</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and discover the mysteries of the Witch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and complete the scattered Altars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Puzzles and unlock powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk, climb and jump, all with Hand-Driven Movements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break objects, open drawers and move objects with natural interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete The Ritual and follow the Witch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553930/extras/b9d0d820bf7a6aa830b4f42f638dc2c4.avif?t=1768389271\" width=1560 height=678 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐾 And most importantly, enjoy the experience and have fun! 🐾</h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be a cat. Climb everything. Breathe.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MeCatVR</strong> is a cozy VR adventure with light parkour. You wander a witch’s warm home and a moonlit courtyard, bat things off shelves, open drawers, and scale a giant tree into the clouds. There’s no text, no HUD, no pop-ups, just natural, hand-driven interactions that keep everything intuitive and language-free. No danger, no rush, just a space to play, explore and feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553930/extras/b7a7a4166572f9742e3f47ff9b660090.avif?t=1768389271\" width=1560 height=678 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you’ll do</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and discover the mysteries of the Witch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and complete the scattered Altars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Puzzles and unlock powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk, climb and jump, all with Hand-Driven Movements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break objects, open drawers and move objects with natural interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete The Ritual and follow the Witch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553930/extras/b9d0d820bf7a6aa830b4f42f638dc2c4.avif?t=1768389271\" width=1560 height=678 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐾 And most importantly, enjoy the experience and have fun! 🐾</h2>",
